cmu-attache-name = Diplomatic Attache
cmu-attache-description = A diplomatic attache, aide to one of the sector's many missions, carrying a satchel full of paperwork and a very firm handshake.
cmu-attache-prefix = ATT
cmu-attache-supervisors = your ambassador
cmu-attache-rules = You are a diplomatic attache. You are neutral to all factions. Assist your mission, mind your paperwork, and do not take up arms unless your life is threatened.
cmu-attache-greeting = You are a diplomatic attache arriving in the theatre. Find your mission, carry your briefcase, and remember: everything is fine, we have a memo for that.
